# Ojas Data Resolver Scope Document

**Version:** v0.3
**Status:** Freeze Candidate v0.1 — pending review of the three deferred sections (two-tier registry, error model, approval workflow)
**Changes from v0.2:**
- Added a non-goals statement to §1
- Added a normative-keywords note to §1
- Added a lifecycle diagram to §5
- Clarified candidate exposure for ambiguity failures in §2 (audit-facing vs. LLM-facing)
- Tightened `GOVERNED_EXTRACTION_RETRY` activation language in §3 (runtime downgrade rule)
- Reworked the §8 retry table by source layer (Extraction/DTO, Resolver, Governance gates) to resolve the boundary inconsistency
